---
// This path briefly existed during an early design pass (a preview of what
// became /about) and was removed from the site before launch. GitHub Pages
// has no server-side redirect capability, so this static page stands in for
// a real 301: an immediate meta-refresh plus a canonical pointing straight
// at /about, which search engines treat equivalently to a redirect. Keep
// this page indefinitely in case the URL was ever crawled or linked
// externally during that period — do not delete it "to tidy up".
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Gary Lucy — Biography</title>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/about" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.garylucy.co.uk/about" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>This page has moved to <a href="/about">garylucy.co.uk/about</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
